1. MemGraphRAG (research reference implementation)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright (c) 2026 DeepLIT Group in Xiamen University
https://github.com/XMUDeepLIT/MemGraphRAG
Licensed under the MIT License.

Paper: Chuanjie Wu, Zhishang Xiang, Yunbo Tang, Zerui Chen, Qinggang Zhang and
Jinsong Su. "MemGraphRAG: Memory-based Multi-Agent System for Graph
Retrieval-Augmented Generation." KDD 2026. arXiv:2606.00610.

Portions of this repository are derived from that implementation, in particular the
three-layer memory model, the ontology / conflict / graph-install indexing stages and
the PPR retrieval semantics. Derived modules include (non-exhaustive):
  memgraphrag/core.py
  memgraphrag/memory.py
  memgraphrag/prompts/templates.py
  memgraphrag/storage/igraph_impl.py
  memgraphrag/utils/step_log.py

